02:53.690 --> 02:59.610
So we need the first name, last name and the same information as well from the employees.

02:59.610 --> 03:02.090
But now we want everything to be in one query.

03:02.090 --> 03:04.850
That's why I'm going to go and remove the semicolons.

03:05.010 --> 03:08.530
And now we have to go and use set operators between those two queries.

03:08.570 --> 03:11.930
